  <p>
    Most recently, I completed my master's thesis in <a href="https://institut-tue.ellis.eu/rml">Robust Machine Learning Group at ELLIS Institute Tübingen</a> focusing on designing and evaluating AI-powered tools for teachers in education.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before my master's I focused on deploying and applying computer vision techniques in a not-for-profit, <a href="https://www.wadhwaniai.org/">Wadhwani AI</a>. I later joined Rephrase AI (now acquired by Adobe), a Series A startup developing virtual avatars, where I worked with generative models, including variational autoencoders, for synthetic speech generation.
  </p>
  <p>
    During my bachelor's, I was part of <a href="https://sustainability-lab.github.io/">Sustainability Lab, IIT Gandhinagar</a> where I used active learning for intelligent air quality sensor placement for optimal coverage at a budget.
  </p>
  <p class="placeholder">
